    your household or organisation Use it.

2.3 Using the Software does not make you a licensee of anything else, and it costs nothing.

2.4 The documents, files and data you create, edit or export with the Software are entirely
    yours. This license does not apply to them, and we claim no rights in them.

3. No modification without our written permission

3.1 You may not Modify the Software, or any part of it, without our prior written
    permission. This includes changing its behaviour, removing or adding features, rebranding
    it, or preparing a modified version for any purpose, private or public.

3.2 You may not distribute, publish, sublicense, sell, rent, lend or otherwise make
    available a modified version of the Software, or any work derived from it, without our
