3.3 To ask for permission, write to **wordking@alking.ai** and say what you want to change
    and why. We are happy to hear from you, and permission, when we give it, is given in
    writing and applies only to what it names.

3.4 Nothing in this section limits rights the law gives you that cannot be excluded, such as
    the right to make a copy for backup, to study the Software, or to correct an error for
    your own use, where such rights exist and cannot be waived.

4. Unmodified copies

4.1 You may copy and redistribute complete, unmodified copies of the Software, free of
    charge, provided that every copy keeps this license file, the NOTICE file and all
